        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Double Thumbturn Pocket Door Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on sliding pocket doors that need easy locking from both sides of the door. Has thumbturns on interior and exterior to lock or unlock it. Adjustable for use on 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" thick pocket doors. It has a built in flip out edge pull, to get the sliding door out of its pocket. Easy to install, it comes packaged with all mounting hardware including the strike plate. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Double Thumbturn Privacy Function:</b> This set locks via the thumbturn on both the exterior and the interior. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-SDLLA325-Specifications.gif?v=1704354721\" width\"523\" height=\"237\" border=\"0\" atl=\"DWD-SDLLA325 Double Thumbturn Pocket Door Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/double-pocket-door-lock-set-with-thumbturns-on-both-sides-sdlla325-sdar325\"><b>Double Thumbturn Privacy Lock for Double Pocket Doors</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-privacy-pocket-door-lock-deltana-sdla325\"><b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock</b></a> & <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-passage-pocket-door-pull-deltana-sdpa325\"><b>Pocket Door Passage Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWith Thumbturns on both sides, it is easy to lock your pocket door from the outside to keep the pets out of the room.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the SDLLA325 Double Thumbturn Pocket Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout: 2-3/4\" High by 1-3/4\" Deep </li>\r\n<li>Thumbturns Both Sides</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDLLA325.pdf?v=1704262349\" target=\"new\"><b>SDLLA325 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDLLA325-install.pdf?v=1704262350\" target=\"new\"><b>SDLLA325 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
